  "prefLabel": "Rev 1501.22 Total original cost in New Hampshire",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1501.22 \"Total original cost in New Hampshire\" means the accounting basis for cost of acquisition of property and all tangible and intangible railroad assets by its present owner, plus the cost of any additions and betterments made by such owner, located exclusively inside of New Hampshire whether or not such costs represent prudent investments.\n\nSource. #10662, eff 8-27-14; ss by #13977, eff 5-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1500.html"
